# The Simplified Technical English backlog, from the ASD-STE100 rewrite.
#
# `vale lint` skips these paths. The list only shrinks. A page that is NOT
# listed is checked, so a page written tomorrow is covered from the day it
# lands, and the rewrite goes in one page at a time without CI going red in
# between.
#
# The standard is docs-redesign/08-simplified-technical-english.md.
docs/api.md
docs/build/team-chat.md
docs/cli.md
docs/configuration.md
docs/sdk.md
